flowchart LR
    start([Start]) --> requirements[(TenderRequirements)]
    requirements --> pending[Select requirements not deduplicated]
    pending --> group[Group similar intent and type]
    group --> dedupe[Deduplication agent]
    dedupe --> store[(TenderRequirementDeduplications)]
    store --> audit[Save deduplication result]
    audit --> finish([Deduplication complete])
